                        "entry_id": "a271f1ff-c97b-3299-bc2a-e72d7b6a1b70",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "funéraires"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f79b5f84-3a48-3ba4-94ef-2536d1a6cdb9",
                        "entry_id": "a271f1ff-c97b-3299-bc2a-e72d7b6a1b70",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a rapport aux funérailles."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2ec9e5a-2b36-4788-bb53-44698c200196",
                                "sense_id": "f79b5f84-3a48-3ba4-94ef-2536d1a6cdb9",
                                "text": "Le Circo Giacomo quitta cette froide ville de l’est sans Troppo qui, parti sur ses deux pieds, allait revenir où il était né dans un fourgon funéraire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6ec9889-8dd8-48d7-a115-e469ab08b035",
                                "sense_id": "f79b5f84-3a48-3ba4-94ef-2536d1a6cdb9",
                                "text": "Frais funéraires."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "37389fe7-115e-33f8-9c27-cfb051578e63",
                        "entry_id": "a271f1ff-c97b-3299-bc2a-e72d7b6a1b70",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a rapport à la mort, aux restes ou au souvenir d’une personne."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7727cf2-641e-43a8-9871-74ae7dc194c4",
                                "sense_id": "37389fe7-115e-33f8-9c27-cfb051578e63",
                                "text": "L’archéologie funéraire livre également des informations d’ordre cultuel avec, par exemple, la nature des dépôts végétaux contenus dans la tombe : litières d’herbes, de fougères, ou offrandes végétales dans des vases qui accompagnent le défunt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "99f9a804-0ead-4f92-92d9-b41ed98328cb",
                                "sense_id": "37389fe7-115e-33f8-9c27-cfb051578e63",
                                "text": "Souvent, histoire de passer le temps, les paléopathologistes entrent dans les églises dans l’espoir d’y repérer une tombe atypique, une relique extravagante, une inscription funéraire plus ou moins attirante."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "92e151a1-f643-4cb2-a07a-834def0a8620",
                        "source_entry_id": "a271f1ff-c97b-3299-bc2a-e72d7b6a1b70",
                        "target_lang_word": "funerary",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "funerary",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed39dc88-4e36-36b7-beaa-994e5def465d",
                                        "entry_id": "635e70f1-eb56-3252-92a1-254dbd1d9e6c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to a funeral."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f5c728a-b20e-4651-ad3e-5ceab2c791bc",
                                                "sense_id": "ed39dc88-4e36-36b7-beaa-994e5def465d",
                                                "text": "The team says it has uncovered Bronze Age burnt mounds which heated water from the River Cole, Iron Age houses and funerary remains, plus evidence of Roman salt processing."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8582b38c-96b4-4c30-8ee9-a8d7f7df6db9",
                        "source_entry_id": "a271f1ff-c97b-3299-bc2a-e72d7b6a1b70",
                        "target_lang_word": "funeral",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "funeral",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df65c748-87c9-3a2e-b07b-6de657f1bb5d",
                                        "entry_id": "7ade1cfe-49be-36b8-8752-4901b71e3f59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ceremony to honor and remember a deceased person, often distinguished from a memorial service by the presence of the body of the deceased."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22ccce80-a10c-4019-8f2b-b47136cdb65a",
                                                "sense_id": "df65c748-87c9-3a2e-b07b-6de657f1bb5d",
                                                "text": "Many mourners turned up at the local artist's funeral to pay homage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67d4b5b4-971e-4cd9-a192-1335652d2f48",
                                                "sense_id": "df65c748-87c9-3a2e-b07b-6de657f1bb5d",
                                                "text": "The taking Away of Righteous & Merciful Perſons muſt be taken to Heart, APPLIED IN A SERMON AT THE FUNERALLS OF Mʳⁱˢ ANNE-MARY CHILD. Wife of THOMAS CHILD Eſq. of North-wick in the Pariſh of Blockley. Worceſter-ſhire.[…]TO THE Exemplarily Vertuous Gentle-woman, his much honoured friend, Mʳˢ ANNE CHILD, Eldeſt daughter of THOMAS CHILD of Northwicke Eſquire. AS I mean not an exerciſe for your modeſty by a flattering Epiſtle, ſo neither doe I intend the renewing of your ſorrows, by preſenting you with the plaine Sermon preach’t at the funerals of your bleſſed Mother."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "272ba5b9-e2ff-3a5c-8387-ee7471d5f11d",
                                        "entry_id": "7ade1cfe-49be-36b8-8752-4901b71e3f59",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A funeral sermon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated",
                                            "in-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "funeral",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                        "entry_id": "f093c63b-2704-334c-ac96-57861e1b64b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of funereal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "uncommon",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c96085d9-c6c9-48ac-935b-5754718bd509",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "All was funeral gloom and hope never whispered its cheering promises there."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aa06d08-de3b-4065-a7c9-78fd71443211",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "Indeed I felt it altogether beautiful; and, as the \"dying day-hymn stole aloft,\" the dim sun-beams fell, through a vista of naked motionless trees, upon the coffin, which was borne with a slower and more funeral pace than before, in a manner that threw a solemn and visionary light upon the whole procession."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f594f0c3-d855-4c30-a42b-803e08f4cebb",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "There was something dramatic and theatrical in the very funeral ceremonies with which Demetrius was honored."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa36a62a-29fc-41a6-982e-ca33586c6e53",
                                                "sense_id": "6c07c695-0466-35bf-82ed-a285b8372b3d",
                                                "text": "The very funeral pageantry disguised behind-the-scenes struggles for control over Sidney's image."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
